{"updated":"2026-10-28T02:28:54.303Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Alexander brothers each sentenced to 30 years in prison in sex trafficking case. Elsewhere, australia’s inflation rate rises to 4.3%, fuelling fears of fifth interest rate hike this year. And politics live: ABC calls for One Nation to ‘immediately remove’ Bluey cartoon; RBA says no recession on way. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.3 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.1 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 2.2 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 42 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.8 near 196 km NW of Port-Olry, Vanuatu. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.13,0.17,0.22,0.24,0.29,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.55,0.58,0.61,0.64,0.69,0.8,0.89,1.04,1.32,1.45,1.5,1.53,1.56,1.6,1.63,1.65,1.67,1.72,1.76,1.83,1.89,1.94,1.97,2.02,2.07,2.1,2.14,2.19,2.24,2.29,2.32,2.37,2.42,2.46,2.51,2.55,2.61,2.68,2.75,2.87,2.96,3.08,3.11,3.15,3.18,3.24,3.29,3.34,3.46,3.55,3.61,3.68,3.74,3.8,3.84,3.9,3.95,3.97,3.99,4.05,4.08,4.1,4.12,4.17,4.21,4.3,4.35,4.41,4.48,4.54,4.59,4.63,4.68,4.7,4.76,4.88,5.03,5.2,5.8,5.93,6,6.07,6.17,6.28,6.33,6.37,6.42,6.44,6.49,6.53,6.57,6.62,6.68,6.7,6.73,6.78,6.9,7.17,7.26,7.31,7.36,7.41,7.45,7.5,7.58,7.64,7.7,7.75,7.8,7.85,7.91,7.93,7.96,8,8.03,8.12,8.32,8.41,8.45,8.49,8.53,8.57,8.6,8.65,8.7,8.73,8.77,8.82,8.87,8.92,8.97,9.03,9.09,9.15,9.24,9.31,9.36,9.43,9.48,9.6,9.68,9.73,9.76,9.8,9.85,9.89,9.94,10.01,10.03,10.08,10.13,10.17,10.19,10.26,10.31,10.46,10.53,10.7,10.76,11.27,11.39,11.45,11.51,11.55,11.59,11.64,11.68,11.74,11.85,11.88,11.97,12.09,12.14,12.18,12.24,12.31,12.38,12.45,12.5,12.55,12.59,12.61,12.67,12.7,12.78,12